{"id": "EUVD-2026-103699", "enisaUuid": "3715b062-d381-3f18-892f-75d7de5733c8", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nBluetooth: ISO: balance the parent hold in hci_bind_bis()\n\nhci_conn_link() takes a lifetime reference to its parent with\nhci_conn_get(), but only takes an operational hold on the child.\nhci_conn_unlink() later balances both a hold and a reference on the\nparent.\n\nThe SCO and CIS paths pass a parent acquired from a connect helper, so\nit already has a hold. For an additional BIS, hci_bind_bis() obtains the\nparent from hci_conn_hash_lookup_big(), which returns a bare pointer.\nUnlinking the child then drops the parent's existing hold and can\nschedule it for disconnection while its socket is still using it.\n\nTake a hold on the parent before linking it and drop that hold if linking\nfails. A successful link transfers the hold to hci_conn_unlink().", "datePublished": "2026-10-18T15:15:08", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:19:55", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ff28e6c67143c76ef50c3eac01f2fad411705f71", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/03a91cdf6862fb351a74f035ad21e70112438552", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4e49206d9574a4c109480198e73aea34ad0ed7f6", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bbcd723ee7a84bc868142fd57717af88e54e555a", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4c94557dd02569efa6c1072a0439addaef9a5224"], "aliases": ["GHSA-w8fc-m2x5-xcfp", "CVE-2026-98459"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.17, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0cf7fa32-0a73-3085-bcbf-7ea1c69fe743", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.6.158"}, {"id": "17dc4609-64e8-38e4-9400-3b2cde08329d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.9"}, {"id": "26cb3a94-245d-3b3b-98f6-85829dafecd9", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "fa224d0c094a458e9ebf5ea9b1c696136b7af427 <bbcd723ee7a84bc868142fd57717af88e54e555a"}, {"id": "2be86ce1-df68-30ac-8b5c-2c4842aec0d9", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "41fed929-f0bf-36d4-8665-3c68c5e595c6", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "11dc486ed5d4626e6b92a23b67ed76cb6c48bfc9 <ff28e6c67143c76ef50c3eac01f2fad411705f71"}, {"id": "8aaacc5c-0d66-316a-bd41-05757ab5345b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "fa224d0c094a458e9ebf5ea9b1c696136b7af427 <4e49206d9574a4c109480198e73aea34ad0ed7f6"}, {"id": "97953eb2-9991-3f97-930a-24a283e27726", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "fa224d0c094a458e9ebf5ea9b1c696136b7af427 <4c94557dd02569efa6c1072a0439addaef9a5224"}, {"id": "9af713f6-0ce0-3b5e-9049-89a72f1cbda4", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.55"}, {"id": "b69d1152-08fa-3c51-b1e6-61e96e8a6d0d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.112"}, {"id": "b9ac5e9d-cd9f-387b-8551-f8137d3b4541", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "fa224d0c094a458e9ebf5ea9b1c696136b7af427 <03a91cdf6862fb351a74f035ad21e70112438552"}, {"id": "d6851e38-4f11-3c22-af21-5af24cf2a363", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "f0498a00-05e8-36cd-bc38-f3d5f5ce391a", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.6.67 <6.6.158"}, {"id": "f45518ff-8b68-35b8-b5c2-4f3c277adbb1", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.8"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "8cb51b3a-35db-309f-892e-1534eccec7a9", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}